BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20230711T015324Z
DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nEx Council\, Workflow\, Workbench\nSynopsis\n:\nImagi
	ne that the progress of customer requests can be tracked like a parcel fro
	m Amazon\, wouldn’t the customer and employee experience be seamless? To
	 realise this vision\, we are equipping the bank with Workflow Workbench b
	y having consolidating tasks from various systems into a single interface 
	to reduce toil and enable better collaboration.\nSpeaker\n:\nLinda Sim Pen
	g LEE\nJoining Instructions\n(In-Person)\n:\nDBS Asia East/Asia West Audit
	orium (#03-00 Marina Bay Financial Centre Tower 3\, Singapore  018983\, Si
	ngapore)\nJoining Instructions\n(via Webex)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a fir
	st time participant using DBS laptop\, you must follow this  One Time Webe
	x Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4 <https://dbs1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/per
	sonal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=
	SzBDh2>  guide prior to the event. This will install Webex Meeting App fro
	m DBS Software Centre for optimal streaming experience!\n1.	On the day of 
	the event\, click on this hyperlink: Webex Events URL <https://dbs.webex.c
	om/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=e3cf8eeba38e206605d89de4272e0e8da> \n2.	Enter yo
	ur First Name\, Last Name\, Email Address and click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJ
	oin via Mobile Device\n1.	Download Webex Meetings App from Apple App Store
	 or Google PlayStore\nClick on Join Meeting & Input Meeting Number: 2514 0
	51 6829\n2.	Input Password 1234\n \n \nJoin via Phone (audio only)\nDial: 
	 +65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial:  +852-3018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-
	22-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDial:  +91-40-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMe
	eting Number:  2514 051 6829\nGlobal call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.co
	m/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e676867362e0173666ba5856cc26881d5> \n \n \n \n
	 \n \n
DTEND;TZID="Singapore Standard Time":20230719T155000
